  "body": "Your lifestyle upgrade starts here!    \r\n\r\nLooking for something a little special?  Welcome to a home that combines thoughtful design, comfort, quality extras and the relaxed coastal lifestyle Gulf Harbour is famous for. \r\n\r\nBeautifully designed with growing families in mind, this spacious duplex offers three bedrooms, 2.5 bathrooms and a clever floor plan that provides privacy and plenty of room for everyone.  One of the standout features is the clever bedroom arrangement, with the master bedroom privately positioned away from the other two bedrooms. Perfect for parents wanting their own peaceful retreat while the rest of the family enjoys their space.\r\n\r\nThe living area flows effortlessly onto the balcony, where you can sit back, relax and enjoy the MARINA outlook.  A lovely spot for your morning coffee, evening drinks or simply unwinding at the end of the day.\r\n\r\nTHE GOODIES YOU'LL LOVE:\r\n* MARINA and sea views\r\n* Three generous bedrooms.\r\n* 2.5 bathrooms, including a private ensuite.\r\n* Privately positioned master bedroom, separate from the other bedrooms.\r\n* Spacious living area opening onto a balcony with marina views.\r\n* Single internal-access garage plus additional off-street parking.\r\n* RENDERED Block/brick or similar material construction, concreate tile roof.\r\n* Underfloor heating in tiled areas - a welcome comfort during cooler months.\r\n* Central vacuum, security systems\r\n\r\nTHE GULF HARBOUR LIFESTYLE IS WAITING!\r\nLocation is everything, and here you can enjoy the best of Gulf Harbour living.  Take a stroll around the marina, enjoy the beautiful coastal walkways, spend time at nearby beaches, or make the most of the golf course, local cafés and restaurants.  With local shops, schools and ferry connections to Auckland CBD within easy reach, you can enjoy a relaxed coastal lifestyle without feeling disconnected.  Whether you are a growing family, a professional couple wanting extra space, or simply looking for a comfortable home in a desirable coastal community, this property deserves your attention.\r\n\r\nSpace, privacy, quality extras and marina views - this is Gulf Harbour living at its best!  Don't just dream about the lifestyle - come and experience it!\r\n\r\nCall Lilia today to arrange your private viewing.  Vacant possession available, you can be in your new home before Christmas!\r\n\r\nSet Date of Sale 15 December by 3PM (unless sold prior)",
